# Normalise line endings to LF in the repository and in every working tree.
#
# Without this, a contributor with core.autocrlf=true checks out CRLF files, Biome's formatter
# normalises to LF, and `pnpm lint` fails on files nobody edited — which happened during M0
# when a branch switch rewrote package.json with CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary-safe: never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary

# Generated; keep diffs readable but do not let anyone hand-edit them into a merge conflict.
pnpm-lock.yaml linguist-generated=true
docs/COMPATIBILITY.md linguist-generated=true
